          "points": 0.25,
          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p><b>Question 2 (0.25 points)</b></p><p><b>Task 1 - Item 2 (0.25 mark):</b> Edit/replace the data of your resource. Copy the content of the <b>books.json</b> file.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p><b>Câu 2 (0.25 điểm)</b></p><p><b>Task 1 - Ý 2 (0.25 điểm):</b> Sửa/thay thế dữ liệu của tài nguyên. Sao chép nội dung file <b>books.json</b>.</p></div>",
          "sampleSolution": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>In the mockapi resource's Data tab, delete the auto-generated rows and paste the provided <code>books.json</code> content (mockapi lets you bulk-edit / import JSON). Each object must match the schema. Sample dataset (values mirror the schema types: <code>bookReadingStatus</code> is a Number 1-3, <code>isUnread</code> is a Boolean):</p><pre><code>[\n  { \"id\": \"1\", \"bookName\": \"CLEAN CODE\", \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/24/200\",\n    \"bookReadingStatus\": 3, \"isUnread\": false, \"bookType\": \"Design\" },\n  { \"id\": \"2\", \"bookName\": \"DATA MINING\", \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/25/200\",\n    \"bookReadingStatus\": 2, \"isUnread\": false, \"bookType\": \"Data Science\" },\n  { \"id\": \"3\", \"bookName\": \"WEB SECURITY\", \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/26/200\",\n    \"bookReadingStatus\": 1, \"isUnread\": true, \"bookType\": \"Security\" },\n  { \"id\": \"4\", \"bookName\": \"REACT PATTERNS\", \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/27/200\",\n    \"bookReadingStatus\": 2, \"isUnread\": false, \"bookType\": \"Design\" },\n  { \"id\": \"5\", \"bookName\": \"MACHINE LEARNING\", \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/28/200\",\n    \"bookReadingStatus\": 1, \"isUnread\": true, \"bookType\": \"Data Science\" }\n]</code></pre><p>Verify: opening <code>GET {API_URL}/SE123456</code> in the browser returns this array.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Trong tab Data của resource trên mockapi, xoá các dòng tự sinh và dán nội dung <code>books.json</code> được cấp (mockapi cho phép sửa hàng loạt / import JSON). Mỗi object phải khớp schema. Dữ liệu mẫu (giá trị đúng kiểu schema: <code>bookReadingStatus</code> là Number 1-3, <code>isUnread</code> là Boolean):</p><pre><code>[\n  { \"id\": \"1\", \"bookName\": \"CLEAN CODE\", \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/24/200\",\n    \"bookReadingStatus\": 3, \"isUnread\": false, \"bookType\": \"Design\" },\n  { \"id\": \"2\", \"bookName\": \"DATA MINING\", \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/25/200\",\n    \"bookReadingStatus\": 2, \"isUnread\": false, \"bookType\": \"Data Science\" },\n  { \"id\": \"3\", \"bookName\": \"WEB SECURITY\", \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/26/200\",\n    \"bookReadingStatus\": 1, \"isUnread\": true, \"bookType\": \"Security\" },\n  { \"id\": \"4\", \"bookName\": \"REACT PATTERNS\", \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/27/200\",\n    \"bookReadingStatus\": 2, \"isUnread\": false, \"bookType\": \"Design\" },\n  { \"id\": \"5\", \"bookName\": \"MACHINE LEARNING\", \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/28/200\",\n    \"bookReadingStatus\": 1, \"isUnread\": true, \"bookType\": \"Data Science\" }\n]</code></pre><p>Kiểm tra: mở <code>GET {API_URL}/SE123456</code> trên trình duyệt phải trả về đúng mảng này.</p></div>",
